Attribution and license terms of those sources apply to the included data.

1. 实测记录 — data/segments-data.js, data/segments-data.json
   Source: ip-api.com free endpoint (https://ip-api.com/)
   NOTE: the free endpoint is for non-commercial use only. Commercial use of
   these files requires replacing this source (e.g. IPinfo / MaxMind paid data)
   or rescanning with an offline database (DB-IP / MaxMind GeoLite2).

2. IP 归属表（IPv4 → ASN） — data/global-pack.bin
   Source: iptoasn.com (https://iptoasn.com/) — public domain data.

3. ASN 运营类型 — data/global-asn.js（类型字段）
   Source: PeeringDB info_type (https://www.peeringdb.com/) — CC BY 4.0.

4. 机房 / VPN ASN 名单
   Source: bad-asn-list (https://github.com/brianhama/bad-asn-list)

5. 城市数据 — data/city/*.bin
   Source: DB-IP City Lite (https://db-ip.com/) — CC BY 4.0.
   Contains data from DB-IP, licensed under CC BY 4.0. Attribution is required:
   "IP Geolocation by DB-IP (https://db-ip.com)".

6. 云厂商段表 — data/cloud-pack.bin
   AWS: https://ip-ranges.amazonaws.com/ip-ranges.json
   Google Cloud: https://www.gstatic.com/ipranges/cloud.json
   Cloudflare: https://www.cloudflare.com/ips-v4
   Microsoft Azure Service Tags: https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?id=56519
   These are the providers' own published ranges. Azure Service Tags describe
   service endpoints rather than only VM ranges; they are fetched best-effort
   and the build marks the source unavailable if the download fails.

7. 风险名单 — data/blocklists.bin
   Spamhaus DROP (https://www.spamhaus.org/drop/) — free for non-commercial use;
   commercial use requires a Spamhaus data subscription.
   IPsum (https://github.com/stamparm/ipsum) — aggregated blocklist, see the
   repository for its license terms.
   Tor bulk exit list (https://check.torproject.org/torbulkexitlist) — Tor Project.
   blocklist.de (https://www.blocklist.de/) — free for non-commercial use;
   commercial use requires a fee agreement with blocklist.de.
   Hits are shown as annotations only: being listed is a fact about the address,
   not a conclusion that it is not residential.

8. 二源 ASN 分歧 — data/asn-disagree.bin
   DB-IP ASN Lite (https://db-ip.com/) — CC BY 4.0, monthly snapshot.
   Contains data from DB-IP, licensed under CC BY 4.0. Attribution is required:
   "IP Geolocation by DB-IP (https://db-ip.com)".
   Only ranges where DB-IP and the IP 归属表 disagree are included; the product
   does not decide which source is correct.

9. 可选联网核验（仅在用户点击时请求，不随本产品分发）
   ipwho.is (https://ipwho.is/), ip-api.com (https://ip-api.com/)

10. 可选实测取证（仅在用户点击时请求，不随本产品分发）
   RDAP: rdap.org and the RIRs; DNS over HTTPS: Cloudflare (https://cloudflare-dns.com/)
   and Google (https://dns.google/); BGP data via Team Cymru (whois.cymru.com) and
   RIPEstat / RIS (https://stat.ripe.net/); host scan data via Shodan InternetDB
   (https://internetdb.shodan.io/).

11. 国旗图片 — flagcdn.com (https://flagcdn.com/)（页面运行时加载）
